{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1066489-reaching","id":1066489,"title":"Reaching","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-03-22T11:34:35-07:00","id":1066489,"title":"Reaching","content":"I have a question on what can be done with reaching. The guidelines on page 112 are pretty clear. However when you look at the sample rotes the reach effects they list go beyond those guidelines. So my question is besides what is listed on 112 what else can be done with a reach to a spell?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12662-bestial-warlust","name":"bestial Warlust","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"60"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-22T11:38:34-07:00","id":1066493,"title":"","content":"That depends entirely on the spell. Generally a Reach clause will either enhance or refine the original function of the spell. You could take a look at the Creative Thaumaturgy thread for more examples.<br /> <br /> The way I usually do it is when I come up with a cool spell idea I break it down to it's absolute simplest function and its overall theme. Then anything else cool I might want to do with that same spell that fits its theme but is beyond that base function can be crafted into a Reach clause.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2632,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","user":"Mrmdubois","date":". 03-22-2017, 02:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-22T11:40:12-07:00","id":1066495,"title":"","content":"Everybody is going to have a different answer to this. It'll depend on what each storyteller allows in his/her game. Perhaps peruse the creative thaum thread and see what people have done with reaches in that thread?<br /> <br /> --haha ninja'd","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1534-totalgit","name":"totalgit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1534_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"742"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-22T12:42:40-07:00","id":1066530,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>bestial Warlust</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1066489-reaching#post1066489\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have a question on what can be done with reaching. The guidelines on page 112 are pretty clear. However when you look at the sample rotes the reach effects they list go beyond those guidelines. So my question is besides what is listed on 112 what else can be done with a reach to a spell?</div> </div> </div> </div>At the top of the sidebar on page 112:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Most spells list Reach effects, and several Attainments that modify spellcasting require Reach to use. In addition to these, one Reach may\u2026 </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-22T14:00:07-07:00","id":1066565,"title":"","content":"It's hard to talk about in general terms because of how varied spells can be, but if you're looking to create your own Reach Effects for Creative Thaumaturgy, something that might help is thinking about it in terms of &quot;what would this do if it was *even better*?&quot;<br /> <br /> A Reach can accelerate a spell's effects (e.g. Sever Soul's Enervated condition comes about faster), add/improve/worsen conditions (Cold Snap creates an additional stronger environmental tilt, Telekinetic Strike inflicts Knocked Down), slightly adapt to changing conditions (Nightvision), etc.<br /> <br /> +2 Reach and a Mana sometimes allows to cast a spell Reflexively (<u>use sparingly</u>).<br /> <br /> So, potentially, a Life spell that increases healing speed (instead of burst healing like Knit) might, with a reach, make physical Tilts lapse much faster, or maybe even &quot;drink&quot; any blood that falls on the target for a mini-burst-heal.<br /> <br /> Stuff like that. Generally speaking, &quot;how could someone boost the spell if they were stronger than necessary/&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\">Bearer of the legacy of Trauma Bear<br /> Need a dice-roller? Check out <a href=\"http://bit.ly/dicemat\" target=\"_blank\">Dicemat</a>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/43-fata-ku","name":"Fata-Ku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar43_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2240"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}